<Slide style={{ width: 1280, height: 720, background: '#FFFFFF', padding: '24px 64px 0' }}>
    {/* A 区 */}
    <Box style={{ height: 96, flexDirection: 'column', justifyContent: 'flex-start' }}>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 32, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#0F1423' }}>
   之内容：<span style={{ color: '#FA4F24' }}>技术组件全景清单与六类资产</span>
      </Text>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 20, color: '#8A8F99', marginTop: 8 }}>
     按层归类只是形式，按「锁定风险」标记才是重点
  </Text>
    </Box>
    <Box style={{ height: 1, background: '#E8E8E8' }} />

    {/* B 区 */}
    <Box style={{ paddingTop: 22, paddingBottom: 12, height: 479, flexDirection: 'row', gap: 20 }}>
        {/* 左 六类资产 */}
        <Box style={{ width: 470, flexDirection: 'column', gap: 7 }}>
       <Text style={{ fontSize: 20, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#0F1423' }}>按层归类的六类资产</Text>
    {[
  { l: 'L1', t: '基础设施', d: '机房、网络、硬件', n: '12 项', c: '#C9CCD4', tc: '#3A4050' },
   { l: 'L2', t: '资源平台', d: '计算存储网络资源池', n: '6 项', c: '#8A8F99', tc: '#FFFFFF' },
     { l: 'L3', t: '中间件', d: '数据库 / 注册 / 配置 / 搜索', n: '19 项', c: '#5A6072', tc: '#FFFFFF' },
    { l: 'L4', t: '技术服务', d: '网关 / 消息 / 缓存 / 调度', n: '14 项', c: '#2A2F3D', tc: '#FFFFFF' },
      { l: 'L5', t: '运行环境', d: '容器 / 虚机 / 边缘', n: '4 项', c: '#0F1423', tc: '#FFFFFF' },
        { l: '—', t: '自研公共件', d: '各团队自建的可复用件', n: '23 项', c: '#FA4F24', tc: '#FFFFFF' },
    ].map((it, i) => (
     <Box key={i} style={{ flex: 1, background: it.c, borderRadius: 4, flexDirection: 'row', alignItems: 'center', padding: '0 14px', gap: 12 }}>
     <Text style={{ fontSize: 15, fontWeight: 'bold', color: it.tc, width: 30 }}>{it.l}</Text>
      <Text style={{ fontSize: 16, fontWeight: 'bold', color: it.tc, width: 96 }}>{it.t}</Text>
       <Text style={{ fontSize: 12, color: it.tc, opacity: 0.88, flex: 1, lineHeight: 1.35 }}>{it.d}</Text>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 13, fontWeight: 'bold', color: it.tc, width: 48, textAlign: 'right' }}>{it.n}</Text>
      </Box>
   ))}
            <Text style={{ fontSize: 13, color: '#3A4050', lineHeight: 1.5, marginTop: 3 }}>
     最后一行「自研公共件」是最容易失控的一类。23 项里可能有一半功能重复，
    合并收益往往比新建一个大还多。
   </Text>
     </Box>

        {/* 右 锁定风险分级 */}
        <Box style={{ flex: 1, flexDirection: 'column', gap: 7 }}>
    <Text style={{ fontSize: 20, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#0F1423' }}>按锁定风险分级（这才是重点）</Text>
     <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'row', gap: 4 }}>
       {['风险等级', '判据', '处置'].map((t, i) => (
     <Box key={i} style={{ flex: i === 1 ? 2.4 : 1, background: '#0F1423', padding: '7px 4px', alignItems: 'center', borderRadius: 2 }}>
                <Text style={{ fontSize: 13, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#FFFFFF' }}>{t}</Text>
        </Box>
        ))}
      </Box>
   {[
   { r: '高', j: '单一厂商 + 无替代 + 深度改造过', a: '列入替换计划', c: '#FA4F24', tc: '#FFFFFF' },
    { r: '中', j: '单一厂商但有标准接口', a: '保持合同可控', c: '#FBA15C', tc: '#3A2000' },
     { r: '低', j: '标准件，接口通用', a: '正常运维', c: '#FDC69A', tc: '#3A2000' },
 ].map((it, i) => (
       <Box key={i} style={{ flex: 1, flexDirection: 'row', gap: 4, alignItems: 'stretch' }}>
       <Box style={{ flex: 1, background: it.c, borderRadius: 2, alignItems: 'center', justifyContent: 'center' }}>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 17, fontWeight: 'bold', color: it.tc }}>{it.r}</Text>
   </Box>
         <Box style={{ flex: 2.4, background: '#F7F7F8', borderRadius: 2, padding: '0 12px', justifyContent: 'center', flexDirection: 'column' }}>
       <Text style={{ fontSize: 12, color: '#3A4050', lineHeight: 1.4 }}>{it.j}</Text>
     </Box>
      <Box style={{ flex: 1, background: '#F7F7F8', borderRadius: 2, padding: '0 8px', justifyContent: 'center', flexDirection: 'column' }}>
      <Text style={{ fontSize: 12, color: '#0F1423', fontWeight: 'bold', lineHeight: 1.4 }}>{it.a}</Text>
   </Box>
         </Box>
      ))}
    <Box style={{ height: 56, background: '#F7F7F8', borderRadius: 4, padding: '0 14px', flexDirection: 'row', alignItems: 'center', gap: 12, borderLeft: '4px solid #FA4F24' }}>
   <Text style={{ fontSize: 13, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#C43A17', width: 92 }}>★ 高风险红线</Text>
    <Text style={{ fontSize: 13, color: '#3A4050', flex: 1, lineHeight: 1.45 }}>
      高风险组件不得新增强依赖。已有依赖必须同时保留一条替代验证路径，否则不允许进核心交易链路。
     </Text>
    </Box>
        </Box>
    </Box>

    {/* C 区 */}
    <Box style={{ height: 58, flexDirection: 'row', alignItems: 'center', borderTop: '1px solid #E8E8E8' }}>
        <Box style={{ width: 10, height: 10, background: '#FA4F24' }} />
    <Text style={{ fontSize: 13, color: '#8A8F99', marginLeft: 12 }}>硕磐机密 · TA技术架构咨询方法论</Text>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 13, color: '#8A8F99', marginLeft: 'auto' }}>10 / 30</Text>
    </Box>
</Slide>